OL,3,GNEWSAEx-first minister Mark Drakeford
OL,4,Asuggests Wales Office should go
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Labour First Minister Mark
OL,7,FDrakeford has said it is time to
OL,8,Fconsider scrapping the UK government's
OL,9,FWales Office.
OL,11,FDrakeford said "the time has come" to
OL,12,Fthink about abolishing the department,
OL,13,Fwhich was largely stripped of its
OL,14,Fpowers when devolution began in 1999.
OL,16,FAsked on S4C's Y Byd yn ei Le if he
OL,17,Fwould be happy to get rid of the Wales
OL,18,FOffice, Drakeford said: "Yes, I think
OL,19,Fthe time has come for us to think about
OL,20,Fthat."
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
