OL,3,GNEWSAEx-first minister Mark Drakeford
OL,4,Asuggests Wales Office should go
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Labour MP Ruth Jones described the
OL,7,Fsuggestion as "foolish", arguing Welsh
OL,8,FSecretary Stephen Kinnock was "fighting
OL,9,Fthe corner for Wales".
